            "question": "{\"content\":\"<style>\\n    /* 2535. */\\n    .text-container {\\n      cursor: pointer;\\n      max-width: 20px;\\n      white-space: normal; /* Allow the text to wrap */\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n      position: relative;\\n      line-height: 1.4; /* Adjust for better readability */\\n      transition: max-width 0.3s ease-in-out, max-height 0.3s ease-in-out; /* Smooth transition for expanding */\\n      max-height: 1.4em; /* Set to line height to show only the first line */\\n    }\\n    .text-container::after {\\n      content: '  ...  ';\\n      position: absolute;\\n      right: 0;\\n      bottom: 0;\\n      color: #d5d5d5;\\n      background:  #f0f0f0;\\n      width: 100%;\\n      text-align: right;\\n    }\\n    .text-container:hover {\\n      max-width: 350px; /* Adjust as needed for hover */\\n      max-height: none; /* Allow it to expand to fit content */\\n    }\\n    .text-container:hover::after {\\n      display: none; /* Hide the ellipsis on hover */\\n    }\\n    a:link, a:visited {\\n        color: black;\\n    }\\n    resize-img. {\\n        max-height:450px;\\n        min-width:350px;\\n        width:auto;\\n        display:block;\\n        margin:auto;\\n        background-color: #131516;\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n<span><b><a href=\\\"https://leetcode.com/problems/difference-between-element-sum-and-digit-sum-of-an-array\\\">2535. Difference Between Element Sum and Digit Sum of an Array</a></b></span>\\n<div>Calculate the absolute difference between the sum of elements and the sum of digits in a given array of positive integers.</div>\\n<div class=\\\"text-container\\\"><br/>1. Given an array `nums` of positive integers.<br/>2. Calculate two sums:<br/>   - <b>Element Sum</b>: Sum of all elements in `nums`.<br/>   - <b>Digit Sum</b>: Sum of all individual digits of the elements in `nums`.<br/>3. Find the absolute difference between these two sums.<br/><br/></div>\\n<div>- [nums = [1,15,6,3]] => 9</div>\\n<div class=\\\"text-container\\\"><br/>Example 1:<br/><br/>Input: nums = [1,15,6,3]<br/>Output: 9<br/>Explanation: <br/>The element sum of nums is 1 + 15 + 6 + 3 = 25.<br/>The digit sum of nums is 1 + 1 + 5 + 6 + 3 = 16.<br/>The absolute difference between the element sum and digit sum is |25 - 16| = 9.<br/><br/><br/>Example 2:<br/><br/>Input: nums = [1,2,3,4]<br/>Output: 0<br/>Explanation:<br/>The element sum of nums is 1 + 2 + 3 + 4 = 10.<br/>The digit sum of nums is 1 + 2 + 3 + 4 = 10.<br/>The absolute difference between the element sum and digit sum is |10 - 10| = 0.<br/></div>\\n<div class=\\\"text-container\\\"><br/>1 <= nums.length <= 2000<br/>1 <= nums[i] <= 2000<br/></div>\\n<span>\\n<a href=\\\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wg-szN5zvr4&pp=ygU-MjUzNS4gRGlmZmVyZW5jZSBCZXR3ZWVuIEVsZW1lbnQgU3VtIGFuZCBEaWdpdCBTdW0gb2YgYW4gQXJyYXk%3D\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" x=\\\"0px\\\" y=\\\"0px\\\" width=\\\"30\\\" height=\\\"25\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 48 48\\\">\\n<path fill=\\\"#FF3D00\\\" d=\\\"M43.2,33.9c-0.4,2.1-2.1,3.7-4.2,4c-3.3,0.5-8.8,1.1-15,1.1c-6.1,0-11.6-0.6-15-1.1c-2.1-0.3-3.8-1.9-4.2-4C4.4,31.6,4,28.2,4,24c0-4.2,0.4-7.6,0.8-9.9c0.4-2.1,2.1-3.7,4.2-4C12.3,9.6,17.8,9,24,9c6.2,0,11.6,0.6,15,1.1c2.1,0.3,3.8,1.9,4.2,4c0.4,2.3,0.9,5.7,0.9,9.9C44,28.2,43.6,31.6,43.2,33.9z\\\"></path><path fill=\\\"#FFF\\\" d=\\\"M20 31L20 17 32 24z\\\"></path>\\n</svg></a>\\nJS: <a href=\\\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wr3D96Ln2Yg&pp=ygVIMjUzNS4gRGlmZmVyZW5jZSBCZXR3ZWVuIEVsZW1lbnQgU3VtIGFuZCBEaWdpdCBTdW0gb2YgYW4gQXJyYXlqYXZhc2NyaXB0\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" x=\\\"0px\\\" y=\\\"0px\\\" width=\\\"30\\\" height=\\\"25\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 48 48\\\">\\n<path fill=\\\"#FF3D00\\\" d=\\\"M43.2,33.9c-0.4,2.1-2.1,3.7-4.2,4c-3.3,0.5-8.8,1.1-15,1.1c-6.1,0-11.6-0.6-15-1.1c-2.1-0.3-3.8-1.9-4.2-4C4.4,31.6,4,28.2,4,24c0-4.2,0.4-7.6,0.8-9.9c0.4-2.1,2.1-3.7,4.2-4C12.3,9.6,17.8,9,24,9c6.2,0,11.6,0.6,15,1.1c2.1,0.3,3.8,1.9,4.2,4c0.4,2.3,0.9,5.7,0.9,9.9C44,28.2,43.6,31.6,43.2,33.9z\\\"></path><path fill=\\\"#FFF\\\" d=\\\"M20 31L20 17 32 24z\\\"></path>\\n</svg></a>\\nSolutions:<a href=\\\"https://leetcode.com/problems/difference-between-element-sum-and-digit-sum-of-an-array/solutions/\\\">[1]</a></span>\"}",
            "answer": "{\"content\":\"<b><a href=\\\"https://leetcode.com/problems/difference-between-element-sum-and-digit-sum-of-an-array/solutions/3052590/js-one-line/\\\">- Algorithm: Sum Calculation with Array Reduction</a></b>\\n<div class=\\\"text-container\\\"><br/>var differenceOfSum = function (nums) {<br/>  // nums: array of positive integers<br/>  // The function calculates the absolute difference between the sum of elements and the sum of digits<br/><br/></div>\\n<div>var differenceOfSum = function (nums) {<br/>  return Math.abs(nums.reduce((p, v) => p + v) - nums.join(\\\"\\\").split(\\\"\\\").reduce((p, v) => +p + +v));</div>\\n<div>1. Use `reduce` to calculate the sum of all elements in `nums`.<br/>2. Convert `nums` to a string, split it into individual digits, and calculate the sum of these digits.<br/>3. Calculate the absolute difference between the element sum and the digit sum.</div>\\n<div class=\\\"text-container\\\"><br/>The solution involves two main steps: calculating the element sum and the digit sum. The element sum is straightforward, using `reduce` to add all numbers in the array. The digit sum is calculated by first converting the array into a string, splitting it into individual characters (digits), and then summing these digits. Finally, the absolute difference between these sums is computed.<br/><br/></div>\\n<div class=\\\"text-container\\\"><br/></br></br>No 'Shorter/Alternative Solution' section found<br/><br/></div>\\n<div class=\\\"text-container\\\"><br/>The time complexity of the solution is O(n), where n is the number of elements in `nums`. This is due to the single pass required to calculate each sum.</div>\"}",
